  66   
  67  parameter
  68          rto(g,r)        Output (or income) subsidy rates
  69          rtf(f,g,r)      Primary factor and commodity rates taxes
  70          rtfd(i,g,r)     Firms domestic tax rates
  71          rtfi(i,g,r)     Firms' import tax rates
  72          rtxs(i,r,s)     Export subsidy rates
  73          rtms(i,r,s)     Import taxes rates;
